"""uireview — before/after or after-only visual evidence for UI changes, served privately over the tailnet.

Agents capture paired screenshots with a recipe (or after-only screens, from a recipe or while driving
the simulator), fill short captions in notes.json, and publish to a fixed web shell. The owner judges
each card from a phone; verdicts persist server-side.
Run `uireview -h` or `uireview <command> -h` for usage. Design: docs/plan.md.
"""
